{"version":1,"content":"<p>早前被拒入台的內地男神張凌赫，近日偕劇集《逐玉》拍檔田曦薇舉行兩岸粉絲線上見面會，張凌赫在直播中坦言心願是到台灣跟粉絲交流。</p><p>席上兩人重演劇中名場面，挽臂靠肩甜到漏，而對於「二搭」問題，田曦薇笑而不語，令粉絲大為期待。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:24:25.028018+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T16:01:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T16:17:36.234466+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T16:17:36.234466+00:00","content_hash":"880603b412b351265ff7fe4c1cf43d7adac0442e86b3b6418ee9f03f87093216","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}